        "created_at": "2016-12-20T04:49:17.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>That is a ruling in the video game and by Christopher. &nbsp; It should apply to the current released version and is even mentioned in the release notes&nbsp;http://steamcommunity.com/games/337150/announcements/detail/585863462553546410</p><p>\n&gt; </p><p>Prime Wardens Captain Cosmic’s innate power can no longer be “stacked.” You may only draw or play a card if you shuffle the destroyed construct into your deck.</p><p>\n</p>",
